  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/q1QXwb4.png\" width=\"840\" height=\"105\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/OnwQJyh.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"115\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">***&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shetiphiancore-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">ShetiPhianCore [Fabric]</a> 需要！ ***</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/indium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Indium</a>&nbsp;如果你安裝了 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sodium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium</a>，也需要 *</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">實現您夢中的床。選擇圖案、紋理和顏色。甚至可以在上面繪製您自己的像素藝術！</p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>: <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/multibeds/pages/current\" rel=\"nofollow\">物品配方和資訊</a> :</strong></h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/jZCXSYK.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"85\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/270/814/multibeds_example2.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"470\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/jZCXSYK.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"85\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RVS4GYo.gif\" width=\"650\" height=\"359\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">將紙張、枕頭套、毯子和藝術品應用到您的床上。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g9UJ3tZ.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"650\" height=\"359\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">在遊戲中創建您自己的像素藝術。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ASfK1zp.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"650\" height=\"359\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">多種樣式的床供您選擇。添加任何方塊以更改外觀。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j6DYvno.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"650\" height=\"359\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">點擊毯子在織布機上自定義顏色/圖案。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FTN3gDm.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"650\" height=\"359\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">床自動併入寬/雙層配置。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MWS5OpX.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"650\" height=\"359\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">適合您上下鋪的定制梯子。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/jZCXSYK.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"85\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>在 <a href=\"https://github.com/ShetiPhian/Localizations-and-Issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">github</a> 上提交本地化文件。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>請勿在評論中報告錯誤，請使用 <a href=\"https://github.com/ShetiPhian/Localizations-and-Issues/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題追蹤器</a>。</strong></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
